。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Re_Gatchaman/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/06adaa28/uploads/origins/e446a0a8-e526-4c21-b85e-fe29bac059c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55c1479c44e7e372dc85ff7010b1adb5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/06adaa28/uploads/origins/e446a0a8-e526-4c21-b85e-fe29bac059c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55c1479c44e7e372dc85ff7010b1adb5, https://si.imgix.net/06adaa28/uploads/origins/e446a0a8-e526-4c21-b85e-fe29bac059c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a58edb8b5a0215ab6e2101b10f537ffa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/06adaa28/uploads/origins/e446a0a8-e526-4c21-b85e-fe29bac059c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14a1c86f0ba9d0f57db795fcebf9388b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "あなたの画風が大好きです!私のVtuberのモデルを描いていただけませんか？彼女はヴァンパイアのバニーで、とても遊び好きで魅惑的なんだ。ポーズも自由自在です。ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/DFOeb53", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Re_Gatchaman/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a5283410/uploads/origins/32124146-fb45-4540-81da-cddb11d5c419?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=776bc5781ba2917dbda431830bc1076b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a5283410/uploads/origins/32124146-fb45-4540-81da-cddb11d5c419?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=776bc5781ba2917dbda431830bc1076b, https://si.imgix.net/a5283410/uploads/origins/32124146-fb45-4540-81da-cddb11d5c419?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd2f37278274c3f9979584581de97504 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a5283410/uploads/origins/32124146-fb45-4540-81da-cddb11d5c419?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a05dd4cc8907184190937cb1b03add2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body"